59:- `TipCard`: the one look of every tip, with an icon, title, message and dismiss action. Do not build a tip from `Spacing` tokens, and do not set its colour, font or padding on a screen.
60:- `TipCardStyle`: the `TipViewStyle` that draws a TipKit tip with `TipCard` and invalidates the tip on dismiss. Pass it to `.tipViewStyle` and do not write a second style.
98:- `tipIcon`: only for `TipCard`, as the size of its icon. Do not use it to size another symbol.
99:- `tipIconNudge`: only for `TipCard`, as the small drop that lines its icon up with the title. Do not use it to nudge another symbol.
100:- `tipDismissGlyph`: only for `TipCard`, as the size of its dismiss glyph. Do not use it to size another button's symbol.
